# NSING Ethernet PHY configuration
#

config JL1111_PHY
	tristate "JLSemi JL1111 Fast Ethernet PHY"
	help
	  Supports the JLSemi JL1111 10/100 Mbps Ethernet PHY.  The driver
	  also configures the RMII reference clock direction so that the PHY
	  drives REF_CLK for MACs that consume it.
	  To build the driver as a module, choose M here.
